---
/** Credits for PlaceMap, rendered as a footnote at the end of the page. */
---

<p id="map-sources" class="map-sources">
  <span class="map-sources-mark" aria-hidden="true">*</span>
  Map terrain from Mapzen terrain tiles (USGS 3DEP, SRTM, and GMTED2010; NOAA ETOPO1; and
  <a href="https://github.com/tilezen/joerd/blob/master/docs/attribution.md">other sources</a>). Outlines from Natural
  Earth and the US Census.
</p>

<style>
  .map-sources {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .map-sources-mark {
    color: var(--contour);
  }
</style>
